{"ref":"BDB, מַקֵּדָה","hw":"מַקֵּדָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מַקֵּדָה</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.loc.</strong> in Judah <a data-ref=\"Joshua 15:41\" href=\"/Joshua.15.41\">Jos 15:41</a>, near Beth Horon <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:10\" href=\"/Joshua.10.10\">Jos 10:10</a>, and Libnah v <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:29\" href=\"/Joshua.10.29\">29</a>, where was a cave v <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:16\" href=\"/Joshua.10.16\">16</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:17\" href=\"/Joshua.10.17\">17</a>, cf. v <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:21\" href=\"/Joshua.10.21\">21</a>, captured by Joshua v <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:28\" href=\"/Joshua.10.28\">28</a>, with a king v <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:28\" href=\"/Joshua.10.28\">28</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 12:16\" href=\"/Joshua.12.16\">12:16</a>. 𝔊 Μακηδα. Site dubious, Warren<sup>Survey Mem. ii. 411 ff., 427</sup> comp. <em>El-mughâr</em>, c. 2¾ miles SW. from Ekron.","next":"BDB, מִקְדָּשׁ","prev":"BDB, מַקֶּ֫בֶת"}